WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000 line:12% position:50% align:center
A Taglish comment is typed in; the three language chips appear.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.500 line:12% position:50% align:center
The ChatSafe landing page rises in.

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.000 line:12% position:50% align:center
The cursor clicks Access Dashboard.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.500 line:12% position:50% align:center
A Reddit URL is analysed; the four pipeline steps light up.

5
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:22.500 line:12% position:50% align:center
Post library: the critical post opens and its threat bar fills.

6
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.500 line:12% position:50% align:center
Analytics: language bars grow, then the bullying breakdown is highlighted.

7
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.500 line:12% position:50% align:center
Batch upload: a CSV file is selected and scanned.

8
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.500 line:12% position:50% align:center
Detect. Protect. Empower. — over a wall of ChatSafe screens.
